            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekiseera kyatuuka, omusaadha omwavu yaafa, bamalaika baamutwala mu kifo Aburahamu mwe yali. Omukombe yeena yaafa, yaaziikibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukombe ng'ali e magombe mu bulumi obungi einho, yaagangamula ku maiso, yaalengera Aburahamu ni Lazaro nga bali ghalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaayeta ati, ‘Aburahamu lata, nsaasira otume Lazaro ainhike olwala lwe mu maadhi, aidhe ampozewozeeku olulimi, kuba ndi kulumizibwa inho eno mu muliro.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Aburahamu yaamukoba ati, ‘Mwana wange idhukira oti mu bulamu bwo wafuna ebirungi byonabyona, aye Lazaro yaafuna ebibi kale mperaano ono n'okuba mu kwesiima, iwe n'oba mu kubonaabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate ghagati waife n'imwe ghaateebwagho olukonko olunene, ng'abo abandyenze okuva eno okwidha eyo tibasobola, waire abenda okuva eyo okwidha eno.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukombe yaakoba ati, ‘Niini nkweghembye lata, mutume eri ab'omu ndhu ya lata wange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba ndiyo ni baganda bange bataanu, abalabule tomanha boona bwe baidha mu kifo kino eky'okubonaabona.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Aburahamu yaamukoba ati, ‘Baganda bo bali ni Musa n'abalanzi, babawulirise.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukombe yaakoba ati, ‘Aburahamu lata, aye bweghabaagho ava e magombe n'aja ye bali, baidha kwenenia.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Aburahamu yaamukoba ati, ‘Oba nga tibawulira Musa n'abalanzi, tibaja kwikiriza omuntu ni bw'alizuukira okuva mu bafu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
